The font files are derivative works of SIL Open Font License 1.1 typefaces
and remain under the OFL. Each family's license, with its copyright and
reserved font name notices, is in the licenses/ directory:

- Format Sans (from Adwaita Sans) — licenses/OFL-sans.txt
- Format Serif (from Crimson Pro) — licenses/OFL-serif.txt
- Format Mono (from JetBrains Mono) — licenses/OFL-mono.txt
- Format Emoji (from Google's OFL emoji font) — licenses/OFL-emoji.txt
- Format Math (from STIX Two Math) — licenses/OFL-math.txt

